'''''Dream Song''''' is an [[Adventure Mission]] on [[Penacony]].

==Steps==
# Speak with Dr. Blues
# Listen to what Clockie has discovered
# Question Sir Whittaker
# Ask Dr. Blues for confirmation
# Return the records
# Enter Dr. Blues' Emoscape
# Speak with Dr. Blues
# Go to where the Dreamweavers gather

